[claude] status: supported — Claude lifecycle hooks are installed and owned
--- stderr ---

# install into settings that have entries of their own
$ runtime install --target claude
exit: 0
--- stdout ---
[claude] install: restart_required — Claude lifecycle hooks installed; restart Claude to load hook changes
--- stderr ---

# uninstall leaves them
$ runtime uninstall --target claude
exit: 0
--- stdout ---
[claude] uninstall: restart_required — Claude lifecycle hooks removed; restart Claude to unload stale hook processes
--- stderr ---

